1 0 0 1 72 732 Tm
() Tj
1 0 0 1 72 714 Tm
(The Reinsurer's obligations under this Treaty shall attach only) Tj
1 0 0 1 72 696 Tm
(after the Company's ultimate net loss arising out of any one) Tj
1 0 0 1 72 678 Tm
(occurrence exceeds two hundred thousand dollars \($200,000\). Once) Tj
1 0 0 1 72 660 Tm
(that threshold has been exceeded, the Reinsurer shall indemnify) Tj
1 0 0 1 72 642 Tm
(the Company for the amount of loss in excess thereof, up to a) Tj
1 0 0 1 72 624 Tm
(further one million dollars \($1,000,000\) of loss excess of the) Tj
1 0 0 1 72 606 Tm
(attachment point, such that the Reinsurer's maximum liability in) Tj
1 0 0 1 72 588 Tm
(respect of any one occurrence shall not exceed $1,000,000. In) Tj
1 0 0 1 72 570 Tm
(consideration of the protection afforded hereunder, the Company) Tj
1 0 0 1 72 552 Tm
(shall pay to the Reinsurer an annual premium in the amount of) Tj
1 0 0 1 72 534 Tm
(four hundred thousand dollars \($400,000\), payable in advance on) Tj
1 0 0 1 72 516 Tm
(the inception date of this Treaty.) Tj
ET
endstream
